59
00:04:10,120 --> 00:04:15,120
After that, the point is that if the electrical equipment is submerged in water

60
00:04:15,120 --> 00:04:19,120
then you do not have to use that electrical equipment

61
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:23,120
i.e. the equipment should be completely dry

62
00:04:23,120 --> 00:04:27,120
