80
00:05:55,120 --> 00:05:58,120
and in that area, you do not have to re-enter

81
00:05:58,120 --> 00:06:02,120
until a trained person does not determine that he is safe

82
00:06:02,120 --> 00:06:05,120
So you have to keep in mind all these points

83
00:06:05,120 --> 00:06:11,120
because of this, we can save the risk of carbon monoxide

84
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:16,120
